lfill guests' requests while dealing with unexpected events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day is unique. Different guests, requests, objectives, and chaos await you. Explore special events, discover recipes, complete quests, and capture the best moments in your photo album.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each day, use the points you've earned to unlock new content. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/6c4246ddcda3efd8c3fb87b8b4998ceb.avif?t=1787593673\" width=870 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/937b8b054f1b2000d6da275b79903297.poster.avif?t=1787593673\" width=226 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/937b8b054f1b2000d6da275b79903297.webm?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/937b8b054f1b2000d6da275b79903297.mp4?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/3c2903cbab44532a246c8a0b6fb237fb.poster.avif?t=1787593673\" width=320 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/3c2903cbab44532a246c8a0b6fb237fb.webm?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/3c2903cbab44532a246c8a0b6fb237fb.mp4?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the grill with intuitive first-person controls. Grill meats to perfection, manage drinks from the fridge, and discover combinations. There's a whole recipe book waiting to be filled.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/9a93c674b0dc0fb8809a308ed918d6ec.avif?t=1787593673\" width=870 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/66cadf76188a5b6d7177f8a94573eb04.poster.avif?t=1787593673\" width=320 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/66cadf76188a5b6d7177f8a94573eb04.webm?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/66cadf76188a5b6d7177f8a94573eb04.mp4?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/12d90eb868a7e5daedbb15232dfae86c.poster.avif?t=1787593673\" width=226 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/12d90eb868a7e5daedbb15232dfae86c.webm?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4736250/extras/12d90eb868a7e5daedbb15232dfae86c.mp4?t=1787593673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two BBQs are the same. Special events, weather changes, unique NPC quests, and minigames keep every session fresh. Photograph the right moments, earn stickers, and build your family album.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" st